  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Peel the sweet potato, then cut into 2cm chunks. Thinly slice the spring onion. Thinly slice the garlic. Fill a medium saucepan three-quarters full with water and bring to the boil for the rice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2339932/photos/large/prep_ingredients-2eab0f6b761f137faea99376df9b8e9a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook chicken-style strips: Heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium deep frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the chicken-style strips, stirring occasionally, for 3-4 mins until browned and warmed through. Remove from the pan. Add the garlic, masala seasoning, 1½ tbs tomato paste and 20g plant-based butter to the pan and cook, stirring, for 1 min or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2339933/photos/large/brown_chicken-a2b1d6840f37bd3383e7c802d0d4c6a3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer curry: Add the sweet potato, half the tomatoes, 60ml (¼ cup) coconut milk, ½ tsp sugar and 60ml (¼ cup) water to the tomato paste mixture. Bring to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low. Cover and cook, stirring occasionally, for 18 mins or until the sweet potato is tender. Stir in the chicken-style strips and cook for 1 min or until warmed through. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2339934/photos/large/simmer_curry-c85a29ac43bbde31f7f4ea0e779bad96.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook rice: While the curry is simmering, cook the rice in the pan of boiling water for 12 mins or until tender. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2339935/photos/large/cook_rice-4de65f0906f9d42ae20201ad78286dd2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Taste the 'butter chicken', then season with salt and pepper. Divide the rice and 'butter chicken' among bowls. Scatter over the spring onion, drizzle with 2 tbs coconut milk and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2339936/photos/large/serve_up-3979ecce2cabce97cc971f669eccc40c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Like it crunchy? Scatter the 'butter chicken' with chopped cashews or slivered almonds, if you have some on hand.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2339937/photos/large/make_it_yours-f2d6c975f2535c29fdce76f27fe5ad1f.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
